Clear input, type 'kill-u-sentinel' (cursor at end)

5
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:16,233
Ctrl-U: the text is removed

6
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:19,207
Ctrl-Y: 'kill-u-sentinel' is restored

7
00:00:19,207 --> 00:00:23,300
Clear input, type 'kill-k-sentinel', Home moves the cursor to the start

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,300
Ctrl-K: the text is removed

9
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:29,339
Ctrl-Y: 'kill-k-sentinel' is restored

10
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:33,200
Clear input, type 'first second' (cursor at end)

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,233
Ctrl-W: the word 'second' is removed

12
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:39,261
Ctrl-Y: 'second' is restored, giving 'first second'

13
00:00:39,261 --> 00:00:42,033
